@host = http://localhost:5087

### Register a user (run this first)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "",
  "password": ""
}

### Login
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "",
  "password": ""
}

### Refresh token
POST {{host}}/api/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": ""
}

### Get container summaries
GET {{host}}/api/containers
Authorization: Bearer 